#: templates/system_update.html
msgid "Support Logs"
msgstr "Registros de soporte"

#: templates/system_update.html
msgid "A record of what has been programmed, installed and changed on this board. Logs are kept on this machine only. They are never uploaded or shared unless you download them and send them yourself."
msgstr "Un registro de lo que se ha programado, instalado y cambiado en esta placa. Los registros se guardan únicamente en esta máquina. Nunca se cargan ni se comparten, salvo que usted mismo los descargue y los envíe."

#: templates/system_update.html
msgid "Record support logs"
msgstr "Registrar registros de soporte"

#: templates/system_update.html
msgid "Download support archive"
msgstr "Descargar archivo de soporte"

